{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00102","headline":"七夕宴悬圃二首 二 · 高宗皇帝","name":"七夕宴悬圃二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霓裳转云路，凤驾俨天潢。\n亏星凋夜靥，残月落朝璜。\n促欢今夕促，长离别後长。\n轻梭聊驻织，掩泪独悲伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}